  "description": "How Does That Grab You? is the second studio album by Nancy Sinatra, released on Reprise Records in 1966. Arranged and conducted by Billy Strange, the album was produced by Lee Hazlewood. It peaked at number 41 on the Billboard 200 chart. The single, \"How Does That Grab You, Darlin'?\", reached number 7 on the Billboard Hot 100 chart, as well as number 19 on the UK Singles Chart.",
